":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题芭蕉士女","author":"高启","text":"秋宫睡起试生罗，闲向芭蕉石畔过。\n怪底早凉欺匣扇，夜来叶上雨声多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王耕云与愚庵倡和诗二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"灌花移石不辞勤，苔润流泉雨后新。\n一坞绿杨鸡犬静，老来欣作太平人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王耕云与愚庵倡和诗二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"欲望城西礼白云，数峰苍翠晚粼粼。\n谁知邂逅东归客，亦是香山社里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦余唐卿","author":"高启","text":"路隔成皋万里关，何由得见故人还。\n灯前梦里匆匆见，猿叫枫林月在山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过湖南舟中卧作","author":"高启","text":"野客分携水店前，浪平舟稳称酣眠。\n午鸡啼处前村近，过尽平湖几曲天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"疏竹三禽图","author":"高启","text":"棘枝疏瘦竹枝低，三鸟寒多每并栖。\n月落山空秋梦断，不知谁个最先啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见花忆故园","author":"高启","text":"春色先从天上来，花枝尽发凤凰台。\n不知别后乡园树，寂寞书窗开未开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松雪翁临祐陵草虫","author":"高启","text":"宣和遗墨画难工，唯有王孙笔意同。\n莫问吴宫与梁苑，一般草露覆秋虫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客舍春暮","author":"高启","text":"酒醒闲写送春诗，细雨残花尚一枝。\n莫向天涯望芳草，客愁多似去年时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闰三月有感二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"非关骑马踏尘埃，病眼昏昏自懒开。\n江上酒徒应共笑，经春不作看花来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闰三月有感二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"绿树残莺偶一鸣，听来方解忆山行。\n今年不是逢余闰，已过春光半日程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皋桥（在阊门内，由汉皋伯通所居得名。唐妓泰娘亦居此焉）","author":"高启","text":"阊门啼早鸦，拂面见飞花。\n绿水通螭舫，红桥过犊车。\n谁寻伯通宅，只问泰娘家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题湘君图","author":"高启","text":"怅望南巡竟不还，泪和湘雨暮斑斑。\n须知竹死愁方尽，莫恨秦人鞭赭山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倪元镇墨竹","author":"高启","text":"倪君好画复耽诗，瘦骨秋来似竹枝。\n前夜梦回如得见，纸窗斜影月低时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王架阁家画马","author":"高启","text":"草草髯奴绀绿衣，王家好马诧新肥。\n解鞍闲立斜阳里，应是城南赌射归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慰人悼亡","author":"高启","text":"朱字箜篌委网尘，月明不见理丝人。\n镜台窗下樱桃树，应是当时折剩春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中晓卧二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"井桁乌啼破曙烟，轻寒薄被落花天。\n闲人晴日犹无事，风雨今朝正合眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中晓卧二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"香断床帏冷未开，雨窗寥落满棂苔。\n休轻一枕江边睡，抛却腰金换得来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚立西浦渡","author":"高启","text":"鬓丝微映钓丝轻，水叶惊风细浪生。\n谁见晚凉人立处，数株杨柳一蝉鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上雨中","author":"高启","text":"江涨随沤欲到门，湿云依树易黄昏。\n幽居常日无来客，何况萧萧雨满村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]